      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你抵达终点那瞬间的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6c99b3a1e94b574e6543dbb3f086f7b5233d7a5aa34f216d238c2b5ac5df10",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a7b7a4de1ea08edd7d94d5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你那充满爆发力的赛况，太令人感动了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "826059428a808904d13abe1aee977db466c3a79b21aa79179241b884c1e46c9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b49e2525dd201f02b631094d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "除了获胜之外还有哪些收获？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9fb572ecf28b7758a36f1dc544912e4b7b092609de410f7f4fee6d179311d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0cf6813a0d4a338e0308920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下场比赛会采取什么样的作战？",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ad9497ef4a7dabb3ef35d0ea001c5af0d7a8da33f70740b120cd2091d9db40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b601350ff5f72d966fd9db7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "称霸激烈的比赛并获得胜利，太精彩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac88303109553d75584ce3e0bd40cfb023a6010dd853548106932993bdfb7f86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a33afd1566cc8e810a1cb67a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接下来最想先做什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde23a6c1d6cdcae5b5b613f74f2a5a1720d0f8f6ca6778aed45bfc9b015ffd3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cf97a37b1330adfce4142cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们都很期待你的下一场竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c2b5bf48a66a450b4955bae8f9f65457c72ee086eb28afb203f496b11c9f44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6077e0c360cd2cf53ee984a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见决赛时会聚集更多的强敌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0173c736b29597ea9675e440991360bd7b5c1e269c845501883708661123d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b6171cc055c54e9ec4e2412",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会针对决赛特地去吃「致胜料理」吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e57567e8face532bb1b30cac81763943187365222b4778a6aaa9b2fbaf16e11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab50834b6c4017c37e3b1e1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请针对决赛说说你的抱负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b8909cb979778ac43ca869bad5125b818db7ce025ce9f9c1d9d1b913373ade",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40450ee389864930a95ef9ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练时会特别注重什么吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a466a12127975df8438610b71bd25286a1be4122aa220e3c446cb8911bcc8a13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c87c468cfe12df6f59bf7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你如同子弹般飞奔的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ec2e949a697fdae66244c8c9b59300271cdb34d1a29792f34010c368c23a39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45db6df4ad7ceadf98746134",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和训练员进行了什么样的作战会议？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b81ca5c0db7dcff648dce754ed084a1a57f1ba345912fa943460dd4fa3eb33a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3ecd61c5d5940d1a6cc5a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必接下来的竞赛对手会越来越强吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0de076c3a77b5bb699000fef645b19176ffa2b4268886da900709b4ce6aecbe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce527f1b737461c742a96c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一下子就好，可以请你把面罩脱掉吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be0da9d64a32b978b2600ca30c19954b0dec5319a937dce7540263f54d7cdf1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56fb4f206d2cbb860cdca3c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d15f6fdfced58652fbc9e3a2f8e7c128e170e92e9d1e781004a50c8ef3855ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb00fdefbdca97012bfe3213",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来下次也会成为一场热血的对决呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d56fd0bdcd8c1e4e83ca22a11fc5c46c8f274b2624163bfa4b8f50d62a2e7cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1b01f6354139041efe56a40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问成为你致胜关键的料理是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "632f9a50aa74df9680d1e364094117aca8a517ee215de1907cd0159b5fa53a83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c686a9278a1038f06092e03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们在竞赛上吸引众人目光的技巧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb345a2b0e0f7a48b53721d6e41e04b4028119405fa136aaba11b19f0074b5fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e0a9e9e7488b2514f068ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你认为自己与对手们的差别在于？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17e7309c9a98accc24a7161089ea48d7131fbee81a5727ba6aac50efd9a670cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f96ef93f7d1d69b7fd1106",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的表现就宛如捕捉猎物时的猛禽一般……",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ab1b5cfc3ce6f7b84e2e93b6c282e71f53e9b2d6b740684c56e58ebc77b573",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "198"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e94fc75f9be50a9c14b9d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也有意见表示期待你们两姐妹在决赛对决喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0350c7ff94863a869d41e60c3794a79bba8d04e724d99b86a6d33ec91096c783",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d969517fae1cd3126f25e01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "抵达终点的那个瞬间，你的脑中在想什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2620f410042760b238f0d13b6e6a2f00b3ff1890359072f173f6420e6f8085ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a7e4492664a2f1a8a051191",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛后，会用什么方式进行保养呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6531b46e1ab2486a6bdcb2ec7a40228d6712ac0b872027e096fdb2d3c87cde4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227fcf1279bb71ba71294cd3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你会中意「怪物」这个别称吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1b7a4e6c757c4a6de377bf1e5ae03a18c16f8132c51149cddffe8e854ca208",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a7c3acedba2f1b4d4d3f0bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你抵达终点瞬间的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c345c2f52b1e6bedfbacee49b896841a12e066f5d700ee76293697e8369d693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc550c00f077cc5731c6d0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下场竞赛该关注的对手是谁？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7f3fa6082c37050ea97c4f82eefd831e1898077521e05a6888656856c71e383",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6149597794119f763fa6c44a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有什么决定性的致胜手段吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76386eab3f1deb47ba79436098f11c7321b02f84793698c242e866a8bd6c1e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df8824542ea62bdec9ddb76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那压倒性的表现，真是令人畏惧的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e61bc0d35f6292808278b34431ac989eddd2def445886b208d0b11e59d5c8fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7764247fe918a775481f2a18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这正是能配得上「女帝」之名的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ffb3df7d1b5c7f8305b0438c55acd7b7514281ac23c56dd1ee7949b2e129111",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "205"
      ]
    },
